          </h2>
          <div
            class="space-y-3"
          >
            <div
              class="flex flex-col p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-line hover:border-ink-3 transition-colors "
            >
              <span
                class="text-xs uppercase font-medium text-ink-3 tracking-wider mb-1"
              >
                <span
                  class="relative inline-block group"
                >
                  <button
                    aria-describedby="tip-saddleY"
                    aria-expanded="false"
                    class="text-left uppercase underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-4 cursor-help"
                    type="button"
                  >
                    Saddle Height (along seat tube)
                  </button>
                  <span
                    class="absolute left-0 top-full z-30 mt-2 w-64 rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-3 text-xs font-sans normal-case tracking-normal leading-relaxed text-ink-2 shadow-lg hidden group-hover:block group-focus-within:block"
                    id="tip-saddleY"
                    role="tooltip"
                  >
                    Saddle height: distance from the center of the bottom bracket (0,0) along the seat tube axis to the 70 mm width mark of the saddle (LeMond: inseam × 0.883).
                  </span>
                </span>
              </span>
              <div
                class="flex items-baseline gap-1"
              >
                <span
                  class="text-2xl font-bold mono-chip tracking-tight text-accent-ink"
                >
                  742
                </span>
                <span
                  class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-3 mono-chip"
                >
                  mm
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div
              class="flex flex-col p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-line hover:border-ink-3 transition-colors "
            >
              <span
                class="text-xs uppercase font-medium text-ink-3 tracking-wider mb-1"
              >
                <span
                  class="relative inline-block group"
                >
                  <button
                    aria-describedby="tip-saddleX"
                    aria-expanded="false"
                    class="text-left uppercase underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-4 cursor-help"
                    type="button"
                  >
                    Saddle Setback
                  </button>
                  <span
                    class="absolute left-0 top-full z-30 mt-2 w-64 rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-3 text-xs font-sans normal-case tracking-normal leading-relaxed text-ink-2 shadow-lg hidden group-hover:block group-focus-within:block"
                    id="tip-saddleX"
                    role="tooltip"
                  >
                    Setback: horizontal distance from the bottom bracket (0,0) to the 70 mm saddle mark. Negative means behind the bottom bracket. An estimate until the knowledge base defines it.
                  </span>
                </span>
              </span>
              <div
                class="flex items-baseline gap-1"
              >
                <span
                  class="text-2xl font-bold mono-chip tracking-tight text-accent-ink"
                >
                  -210
                </span>
                <span
                  class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-3 mono-chip"
                >
                  mm
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div
              class="flex flex-col p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-line hover:border-ink-3 transition-colors "
            >
              <span
                class="text-xs uppercase font-medium text-ink-3 tracking-wider mb-1"
              >
                <span
                  class="relative inline-block group"
                >
                  <button
                    aria-describedby="tip-stack"
                    aria-expanded="false"
                    class="text-left uppercase underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-4 cursor-help"
                    type="button"
                  >
                    Cockpit Stack
                  </button>
                  <span
                    class="absolute left-0 top-full z-30 mt-2 w-64 rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-3 text-xs font-sans normal-case tracking-normal leading-relaxed text-ink-2 shadow-lg hidden group-hover:block group-focus-within:block"
                    id="tip-stack"
                    role="tooltip"
                  >
                    Stack: vertical distance from the bottom bracket (0,0) up to the center of the handlebar. An estimate until the knowledge base defines it.
                  </span>
                </span>
              </span>
              <div
                class="flex items-baseline gap-1"
              >
                <span
                  class="text-2xl font-bold mono-chip tracking-tight text-ink"
                >
                  580
                </span>
                <span
                  class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-3 mono-chip"
                >
                  mm
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div
              class="flex flex-col p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-line hover:border-ink-3 transition-colors "
            >
              <span
                class="text-xs uppercase font-medium text-ink-3 tracking-wider mb-1"
              >
                <span
                  class="relative inline-block group"
                >
                  <button
                    aria-describedby="tip-reach"
                    aria-expanded="false"
                    class="text-left uppercase underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-4 cursor-help"
                    type="button"
                  >
                    Cockpit Reach
                  </button>
                  <span
                    class="absolute left-0 top-full z-30 mt-2 w-64 rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-3 text-xs font-sans normal-case tracking-normal leading-relaxed text-ink-2 shadow-lg hidden group-hover:block group-focus-within:block"
                    id="tip-reach"
                    role="tooltip"
                  >
                    Reach: horizontal distance from the bottom bracket (0,0) forward to the center of the handlebar. An estimate until the knowledge base defines it.
                  </span>
                </span>
              </span>
              <div
                class="flex items-baseline gap-1"
              >
                <span
                  class="text-2xl font-bold mono-chip tracking-tight text-ink"
                >
                  374
                </span>
                <span
                  class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-3 mono-chip"
                >
                  mm
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p
              class="text-sm text-ink-3 leading-snug"
            >
              Setback, stack and reach are estimates; only saddle height is defined by the knowledge base (LeMond).
            </p>
            <div
              class="p-3 rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface space-y-1"
              data-testid="studio-diagnosis"
            >
              <span
                class="text-sm font-mono text-ink-3 uppercase tracking-wider block"
              >
                What your symptoms usually mean
              </span>
              <ul
                class="text-sm text-ink-2 list-disc pl-4 space-y-0.5"
              >
                <li>
                  Numb hands: little and ring finger (ulnar nerve)
                </li>
                <li>
                  Numb hands: thumb, index and middle finger (median nerve)
                </li>
                <li>
                  Neck and trapezius pain
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div
              class="p-3 rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface space-y-1"
            >
              <span
                class="text-sm font-mono text-ink-3 uppercase tracking-wider block"
              >
                Ulnar Neuropathy Risk
              </span>
              <div
                class="flex items-center justify-between"
              >
                <span
                  class="font-mono text-sm font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-tone-danger-line bg-tone-danger-badge text-tone-danger-ink"
                >
                  HIGH RISK
                </span>
                <span
                  class="text-sm font-mono text-ink-3"
                >
                  Δ 40mm
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <button
              class="rounded-full tracking-wide transition-all duration-150 inline-flex items-center justify-center font-medium disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed cursor-pointer px-4 py-2 text-sm bg-cyan-500 hover:bg-cyan-400 text-slate-950 font-semibold shadow-sm border border-cyan-400/40 active:translate-y-px w-full"
              type="button"
            >
              Use in My Profile
            </button>
            <button
              class="rounded-full tracking-wide transition-all duration-150 inline-flex items-center justify-center font-medium disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed cursor-pointer px-4 py-2 text-sm bg-sunken hover:opacity-80 text-ink-2 border border-line active:translate-y-px w-full"
              type="button"
            >
              Restore My Values
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      aria-live="polite"
      class="fixed bottom-6 left-1/2 z-50 -translate-x-1/2 w-[min(92vw,34rem)] rounded-2xl border bg-surface p-4 shadow-lg flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-tone-success-line text-tone-success-ink"
      role="status"
    >
      <div
        class="space-y-1"
      >
        <p
          class="text-sm font-bold"
        >
          Applied to Your Profile ✓
        </p>
        <p
          class="text-xs font-mono text-ink-2 leading-relaxed"
        >
          Saddle 742 mm · Setback -210 mm · Stack 580 mm · Reach 374 mm
        </p>
      </div>
      <button
        class="shrink-0 text-xs font-semibold text-ink-2 underline hover:text-ink"
        type="button"
      >
        Dismiss
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocumentFragment>
`;

